            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Malcolm X's Early Life</strong><br>\nMalcolm X was born Malcolm Little in Omaha, Nebraska, in 1925. His family faced frequent harassment from white supremacist groups, which contributed to his father's death and the fracturing of his family. Malcolm's difficulties in school and eventual imprisonment for burglary marked his early struggles. It was in prison where he began to educate himself and transform his life perspective, setting the stage for his later prominence.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Introduction to the Nation of Islam</strong><br>\nWhile in prison, Malcolm X became introduced to the teachings of the Nation of Islam, a religious movement that advocated for Black empowerment and separation from white society. He changed his surname from \"Little,\" which he considered a slave name, to \"X\" to represent his lost African ancestry. His dedication and charisma quickly elevated him within the organization's ranks after his parole in 1952.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Role in the Civil Rights Movement</strong><br>\nMalcolm X became a leading voice in the fight against racial injustice in America. Unlike other civil rights leaders who advocated for peaceful integration, Malcolm X was known for his advocacy of Black self-defense and the establishment of a separate Black community. His sharp critique of racism and his call for radical change attracted many followers but also controversy.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
